X:21
T:Eclipse Hornpipe. BHp.21
M:C|
L:1/8
N:The last note of each line is missing. The first line ends with
N:a repeat of a previous bar. Most of the last note of the third line
N:is visible and fairly obvious. The second line has neither precedent
N:nor clue so I guessed at f but other notes fit equally well. P.D.
